Q1 Which development methodology would you recommend for this project, and why? Identify two        specific risks the team would face if they chose the wrong methodology for this context.  


Answer:

Recommended Methodology: Agile

Why?
The project requirements change frequently, and the client wants to review working features every two weeks. Agile allows quick changes, regular customer feedback, and incremental development.

Two Risks:

Frequent requirement changes will cause rework and delays.
Project cost and development time will increase.